  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Makuhani Walawi, yaani kabila lote la Lawi wasiwe na sehemu wala urithi katika Israeli. Wao watakula sehemu ya sadaka za Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wala wasiwe na urithi kati ya ndugu zao; Mwenyezi-Mungu ndiye urithi wao kama alivyoahidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na hii itakuwa haki ya makuhani kutoka kwa watu wanaotoa sadaka iwe ni ng'ombe au kondoo: Watampa kuhani mguu wa mbele, mashavu na matumbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtawapa sehemu ya kwanza ya mazao yenu ya nafaka, divai, mafuta yenu na sufu ya kwanza ya kondoo wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katika makabila yenu yote, Mwenyezi-Mungu amechagua kabila la Walawi limtumikie kama makuhani milele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ikiwa Mlawi yeyote atapenda mwenyewe anaweza kutoka mji wowote ule wa Israeli kwenda pale mahali Mwenyezi-Mungu alipochagua, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na hapo anaweza kuhudumu kwa jina la Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wake, kama wale Walawi wengine wanaohudumu mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watapata mafungu yao sawa ya kula, ingawa wanayo mapato kutokana na mauzo ya mali za jamaa zao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kiebrania hakieleweki.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mtakapofika katika ile nchi ambayo Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu atawapa, msifuate desturi za kuchukiza za mataifa hayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pasiwe mtu yeyote miongoni mwenu atakayemtambika mtoto wake wa kiume au wa kike kwa moto, wala mtu apigaye ramli, wala mwaguzi, wala mpiga bao, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wala mchawi, wala mlozi, wala mwenye kutaka kauli kwa mizimu na pepo au kutoka kwa wafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maana yeyote atendaye mambo haya ni chukizo kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu; na kwa ajili ya mambo haya ya kuchukiza, Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, anawafukuza watu wa namna hiyo mbele yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muwe wakamilifu mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mataifa haya ambayo mtaimiliki nchi yao hufuata maongozi ya waaguzi na wapiga ramli; lakini Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu hawaruhusu nyinyi kufanya hivyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu atawateulieni nabii aliye kama mimi kutoka miongoni mwenu, nanyi mtamsikiliza huyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hicho ndicho mlichomwomba Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, kule Horebu, siku ile mlipokusanyika na kusema, ‘Tusisikie tena sauti ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wetu, wala tusiuone tena moto huu mkubwa, tusije tukafa!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Mwenyezi-Mungu akaniambia, ‘Wamesema ukweli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitawateulia miongoni mwa ndugu zao wenyewe nabii kama wewe; nitatia maneno yangu kinywani mwake, naye atawaambia yote nitakayomwamuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeyote ambaye hatasikia maneno atakayosema nabii huyo kwa jina langu, mimi mwenyewe nitamwadhibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini nabii yeyote atakayesema kwa jina la miungu mingine, au atakayejaribu kusema neno kwa jina langu hali mimi sikumwambia aseme, huyo nabii atakufa.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lakini nyinyi mwaweza kusema, ‘Tutawezaje kutambua neno ambalo Mwenyezi-Mungu hakulisema?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama nabii akisema kitu ati kwa jina la Mwenyezi-Mungu, na kitu hicho hakifanyiki au hakiwi kweli, jambo hilo hakulisema Mwenyezi-Mungu; nabii amelisema kwa ufidhuli, nanyi msitishwe na jambo hilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
